      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://misplacedalaskan.com/about-healy-alaska/"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Today the former Healey Coal Mine is a historic site offering guided tours of a miner’s life.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
