      ],
      "source": "https://misplacedalaskan.com/about-healy-alaska/"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Healy’s subarctic climate keeps temperatures below freezing from early October to mid‑April, though chinook winds can lift them to 45°F.",
